<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<scheme version="2.0" title="Ch.9 method validation evidence (acetic acid NIR)" description="ch09_validation.csv: water + 3 vinegars with the 1 mm 2nd-derivative signal at 2258 and 1670 nm and four references (label, ATAGO PAL-Easy ACID 181, titration, PAL-30S). Select Columns puts d2_2258 as the feature and one reference as target; Linear Regression (no regularization) -&gt; Test and Score with Leave one out (RMSE in % acid) and Test on train (R2). Orange regresses reference on signal (direct); the lesson regresses signal on reference (inverse), so only R2 matches exactly. Fieller intervals, LOD/LOQ and the scorecard are not possible in Orange.">
